    "versions": {
      "asv": "Ye know this , my beloved brethren. But let every man be swift to hear, slow to speak, slow to wrath:",
      "csb": "My dear brothers and sisters, understand this: Everyone should be quick to listen, slow to speak, and slow to anger,",
